# Phase 15 C15.1 ledger soak: one world, 10^6 ticks, the exact field
# conservation identity enforced by World::check_invariants every 5,000
# ticks (a violation aborts the run loudly). The full stack is on -
# chemistry, microbial, abiogenesis, and BOTH coupling fractions, with
# shortened ages so old-age deaths keep the remains term busy - so the
# identity is soaked under heavy organism-field exchange (C15.6's long
# half), not on an idle field. The field series records the running
# totals every 5,000 ticks for the record.
campaign phase15-c151-ledger-soak
ticks 1000000
workers 1
seeds 16101
check-interval 5000
base preset phase1
base cells_x 64
base cells_y 64
base initial_organisms 40
base max_entities 4000
base maturity_age_ticks 50
base max_age_ticks 400
base chemistry.enabled true
base chemistry.field_steps_per_tick 1
base chemistry.microbial_enabled true
base chemistry.abiogenesis_enabled true
base chemistry.mutation_q16 4096
base chemistry.excretion_fraction_q16 32768
base chemistry.remains_fraction_q16 32768
condition soak
output events off
output snapshots on
output field 5000
